  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math> plane, putting&nbsp;<math><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, we get,<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br />Coordinates of point <math><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Any general point on the line is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />This must satisfy the given plane<br /><math><mn>4</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />So, coordinates of point <math><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2,0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo></math><br />Area <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;sq. units",
